OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo brings westerly
OL,6,Fsevere gales across all areas with
OL,7,Fstrongest winds near the Moray Coast
OL,8,Ffrom late morning. Frequent showers or
OL,9,Flonger spells of heavy rain.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSevere gales at first,
OL,12,Fstrongest towards the Moray coast,
OL,13,Fwill gradually ease through the
OL,14,Fevening and overnight. Scattered
OL,15,Fshowers at first, becoming dry with
OL,16,Fclear spells overnight.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FDry and bright in the morning.
OL,19,FCloud and rain spread north through
OL,20,Fthe afternoon and evening and becoming
OL,21,Frather windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
