OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,6,Fwindy on Tuesday with showers, mainly
OL,7,Fwest and some heavy. Mainly dry and
OL,8,Fbright but with a few showers on
OL,9,FWednesday. Dry Thursday with bright
OL,10,Fspells and variable cloud.
